# SoulSearch multi-window refactor

Goal: allow multiple independent SoulSearch windows to be open at once and
establish settings identities for future scoped windows. Window settings are
persisted only in memory for the current loaded DFHack/Lua session. This work
does not add settings files, scoped integrations, or base-game UI hooks.

